---
import Base from '~/layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, STATS, HIGHLIGHTS, COUNTRIES, APP_STORE, LIVE_DEMOS } from '~/data/site';
---
<Base title="About Way4Tech - Odoo Developers and Implementers" description="Way4Tech is an independent Odoo implementation and custom module company based in Pakistan, with 180+ modules published on the Odoo App Store.">
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ink-900 text-white">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%, rgba(135,90,123,0.55) 0%, transparent 45%), radial-gradient(circle at 85% 90%, rgba(0,160,157,0.3) 0%, transparent 50%);"></div>
    <div class="container-site relative py-20 sm:py-28">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold backdrop-blur">
          <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent-400"></span> About {SITE.name}
        </div>
        <h1 class="h1 mt-6">Engineers who ship. <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-300 to-accent-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Support that stays.</span></h1>
        <p class="lede mt-6 text-ink-200">{SITE.name} is an independent Odoo implementation and custom module company. We work only on Odoo: implementation, customisation, integrations, hosting and support, plus the modules we publish on the Odoo App Store.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-site">
      <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {STATS.map(s => (
          <div class="card text-center">
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-700">{s.value}</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-ink-600 mt-2">{s.label}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-ink-50 border-y border-ink-100">
    <div class="container-site">
      <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="lg:col-span-2 prose prose-ink max-w-none">
          <h2 class="h3">Our story</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-ink-700">Way4Tech is run by Odoo developers. The same people who scope a project write its modules and support it in production, so nothing is lost between a sales team and a delivery team.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-ink-700">Most of our work is for businesses in Pakistan, the UAE and Saudi Arabia: implementations on Odoo Community, Odoo Enterprise and Odoo.sh, custom modules, migrations between Odoo versions, and integrations with the local tax and payment systems.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-ink-700">The easiest way to judge us is to look at the work. We have <a href={APP_STORE.url} rel="noopener">{APP_STORE.count} modules published on the Odoo App Store</a> under the author name Waqas Riasat, and <a href="/case-studies/">{LIVE_DEMOS.length} live demo systems</a> you can open today. The <a href="/author/waqas-riasat/">author page</a> lists every published module.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-ink-700">We are not an official Odoo partner. If you need an Odoo Enterprise subscription you buy it from Odoo S.A.; we do the implementation and development around it.</p>

          <h2 class="h3 mt-12">What we believe</h2>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold mt-1">→</span><div><strong class="text-ink-900">Extend Odoo - don't fight it.</strong><p class="text-ink-600 mt-1">We inherit from Odoo's base models. No parallel universes that break on every upgrade.</p></div></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold mt-1">→</span><div><strong class="text-ink-900">Community-first thinking.</strong><p class="text-ink-600 mt-1">Most needs can be met on Odoo Community. We recommend Enterprise only when it genuinely pays off.</p></div></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold mt-1">→</span><div><strong class="text-ink-900">Own the outcome.</strong><p class="text-ink-600 mt-1">If something we built breaks, we fix it. No finger-pointing.</p></div></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold mt-1">→</span><div><strong class="text-ink-900">Compliance baked in.</strong><p class="text-ink-600 mt-1">ZATCA, FBR, GST, MTD, WPS - we ship with compliance, not despite it.</p></div></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold mt-1">→</span><div><strong class="text-ink-900">Nothing you cannot check.</strong><p class="text-ink-600 mt-1">Every module we sell has a public store listing with screenshots, and the larger ones have a live demo.</p></div></li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="h3 mt-12">Where we work</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-ink-700">We are based in Pakistan and deliver remotely, with working hours that overlap the Gulf. The country guides below cover the tax, e-invoicing and payroll detail for each market we write about.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2 not-prose">
            {COUNTRIES.map(c => (
              <a href={`/countries/${c.slug}/`} class="chip hover:bg-brand-100 hover:text-brand-800">{c.flag} {c.title}</a>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="lg:col-span-1">
          <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-odoo-gradient p-6 text-white">
              <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">{APP_STORE.count} modules on the Odoo App Store</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-100">Published for Odoo 19 and 20. <a href={APP_STORE.url} class="underline" rel="noopener">See the listing</a>.</p>
            </div>
            {HIGHLIGHTS.map(h => (
              <div class="card">
                <div class="text-2xl">{h.icon}</div>
                <h3 class="mt-2 font-semibold">{h.title}</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-600">{h.desc}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-ink-200 bg-white p-6">
              <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Get in touch</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-600">Ready to scope a project?</p>
              <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary w-full mt-5">Contact us</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
